  Content: 'A feeder school for the AEIOU organization, specializing in various fields
    with a focus on magic and Agartha.


    The majors within AEIOU Academy mirror the 5 branches of AEIOU. The Demon Extermination
    major is the largest by far and the easiest to get accepted into.'
